Package: rpi-essential-tools
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Nikhil M B <nikhilmb002@gmail.com>
Depends: vim, git, curl, net-tools, htop, wget, tree, unzip
Description: Installs essential CLI tools and sets static IP on Raspberry Pi.
 This package installs useful tools like vim, git, htop, curl, etc.
 It also configures a static IP using Netplan and reverts on removal.

